# Component:       repo
# Module:          .doc-check-ignore
# Owning Team:     Platform Enablement Guild (PEG)
# Classification:  INTERNAL
# Purpose:         Files exempt from the file header and definition checks of
#                  scripts/doc-check.sh, as shell glob patterns matched
#                  against the repository-relative path (`*` also matches
#                  `/`). Every pattern states why it is exempt.
# Related Docs:    scripts/doc-check.sh, templates/headers/README.md, ADR-0009

# Documents: Markdown is prose, governed by the document templates, not by
# the code header (CLAUDE.md 6.5.5, 6.5.6).
*.md

# JSON has no comment syntax (templates/headers/README.md).
*.json

# The licence text must stay verbatim.
LICENSE

# Templates contain placeholders instead of real header values; the files
# rendered from them are checked.
*.tmpl
templates/headers/header.txt

# Placeholder files of empty scaffold directories; they hold a scaffold
# marker and are deleted when the directory gets real content.
*.gitkeep

# Code generated from contracts/proto by `make proto`; its documentation is
# the comments of the .proto files, which the generators copy (ADR-0020).
contracts/gen/*

# Dart lock files are generated and rewritten by `dart pub get`, which drops
# any comment; the package versions they pin are documented in the
# service's DEPENDENCIES.md (ADR-0027).
*/pubspec.lock
